      "content": "It's so easy to feel like you've been permanently exiled, but that feeling is a reflection of your pain, not a factual truth about your worth. Even when it feels like everyone is looking away, there are still connections waiting to be found, even if they are small right now. Consider reaching out to a support group or a helpline; they are specifically equipped to listen without judgment and help you navigate these feelings of isolation. You deserve to feel seen again.",
