    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just \"feelings.\" it's a reality. life is built on social ties, and mine are completely severed. i'm effectively a non-person. when a person is socially dead, like, what is the point of staying for the physical part? it just feels like a hollow routine. i'm just waiting for my body to catch up to what's already happened to my life.",
