      "content": "If you are truly feeling like you are a non-person, then the physical routine is just a burden you're enduring. Since the life you're living feels so hollow, the most immediate and real thing you can do is find a way to make the *feeling* of being stuck stop. Please, let a crisis line be the first person you talk to; they are trained to deal with this exact sense of finality. You don't have to face this crushing weight by yourself.",
